<import src="/components/flowbar.wxml" />
<view class="page">
  <template is="flowbar" data="{{step: 3}}" />
  <view class="genhd">
    <view class="gen-row">
      <view class="gen-pct">{{percent}}<text class="pct">%</text></view>
      <view class="gen-word">{{phaseText}}</view>
    </view>
    <view class="pbar"><view class="pbar-in" style="width:{{percent}}%"></view></view>

  </view>

  <view class="generation-error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view>

  <view class="glist">
    <view class="gitem" wx:for="{{chapters}}" wx:key="id">
      <view class="st {{item.status}}">
        <text wx:if="{{item.status === 'ok'}}">✓</text>
        <view wx:elif="{{item.status === 'sheet' || item.status === 'write'}}" class="chapter-spinner"></view>
        <text wx:elif="{{item.status === 'error'}}">!</text>
        <text wx:else>{{item.index}}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="gt">
        <view class="gt-title">{{item.title}}</view>
        <view class="gt-status {{item.status}}">{{item.statusText}}</view>
        <view class="gt-meta">{{item.wordLabel}}</view>
        <view class="failure-detail" wx:if="{{item.status === 'error' && item.errorText}}">{{item.errorText}}</view>
      </view>
      <button class="chapter-retry" wx:if="{{item.canRetry}}" disabled="{{busy}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="retryChapter">{{activeRetryId === item.id ? '重试中…' : '重试本章'}}</button>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="gen-tip">
    按章节性质分节深化具体做法、控制要点与验收闭环，字数随招标页数约束调整，完成后显示实际字数。\n任务执行期间请等待完成，再重试失败章节。已生成正文可在正文页按章扩写。
  </view>

  <view class="placeholder-bar"></view>

  <view class="bottombar">
    <button class="btn ghost {{error ? 'small' : ''}}" bindtap="toBackground">后台生成</button>
    <button class="btn" wx:if="{{error}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="start">继续生成未完成章节</button>
  </view>
</view>
